{"id": "21906", "title": "战国策", "author": "刘向", "category": "文学名著", "count": 34, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/21/21906/21906s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/21/21906.htm", "intro": "战国时游说之士的策谋和言论的汇编.初有《国策》、《国事》、《事语》、《短长》、《长书》、《修书》等名称和本子，西汉末刘向编定为三十三篇。宋时已有缺佚，由曾巩作了订补。有东汉高诱注，今残缺。宋鲍彪改变原书次序，作新注。吴原师道作《校注》，近人金正炜有《补释》，今人缪文远有《战国策新注》。湖南长沙马王堆出土西汉帛书，记述战国时事，定名《战国纵横家书》，与本书内容相似。", "base": "files/article/html/21/21906", "chapters": [{"title": "卷一 东周", "file": "1622396.html", "available": false}, {"title": "卷二 西周", "file": "1622397.html", "available": false}, {"title": "卷三 秦一", "file": "1622398.html", "available": false}, {"title": "卷四 秦二", "file": "1622399.html", "available": false}, {"title": "卷五 秦三", "file": "1622400.html", "available": false}, {"title": "卷六 秦四", "file": "1622401.html", "available": false}, {"title": "卷七 秦五", "file": "1622402.html", "available": false}, {"title": "卷八 齐一", "file": "1622403.html", "available": false}, {"title": "卷九 齐二", "file": "1622404.html", "available": false}, {"title": "卷十 齐三", "file": "1622405.html", "available": false}, {"title": "卷十一 齐四", "file": "1622406.html", "available": false}, {"title": "卷十二 齐五", "file": "1622407.html", "available": false}, {"title": "卷十三 齐六", "file": "1622408.html", "available": false}, {"title": "卷十四 楚一", "file": "1622409.html", "available": false}, {"title": "卷十五 楚二", "file": "1622410.html", "available": false}, {"title": "卷十六 楚三", "file": "1622411.html", "available": false}, {"title": "卷十七 楚四", "file": "1622412.html", "available": false}, {"title": "卷十八 赵一", "file": "1622413.html", "available": false}, {"title": "卷十九 赵二", "file": "1622414.html", "available": false}, {"title": "卷二十 赵三", "file": "1622415.html", "available": false}, {"title": "卷二十一 赵四", "file": "1622416.html", "available": false}, {"title": "卷二十二 魏一", "file": "1622417.html", "available": false}, {"title": "卷二十三 魏二", "file": "1622418.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷二十四 魏三", "file": "1622419.html", "availab